  "slug": "catering-order-request-form",
  "title": "Catering Order Request Form",
  "subtitle": "Take an off-premise catering request: delivery site, access and power constraints, service level, and what the kitchen needs to know before it quotes.",
  "description": "An original intake record for off-premise catering. It captures requester routing, the delivery site with its access, parking, and power constraints, the requested service level and menu direction, a site feasibility screen, the quoting decision, unresolved site requirements, and the handoff into a catering order.",
  "use_case": "Use when a client asks for catering delivered to a site the venue does not control, and the kitchen needs the site facts before it can quote. The request closes when the site screen is complete and either a catering order number is assigned or the request is declined.",
  "risk_tier": "A",
