          "key": "request_boundary",
          "type": "notice",
          "label": "Scope of this request",
          "guidance": "This request records what the client described and what each area confirmed it could deliver. It is not a quote, a confirmed menu, or an assurance that any item can be held safely at the site described. Confirm allergen requirements, transport holding, and any permit or site restriction with the responsible manager before the order is issued."
        }
